<path d="M53 60v0M67 60v0" stroke-width="4.5"/>
<path d="M54 70c3 3 9 3 12 0" fill="none"/>

</g></svg></div>
          <p class="voice-who">40代 男性<span class="voice-tag">板金・塗装</span></p>
          <p class="voice-text">【サンプル】お客様の感想が入ります。<em>仕上がりの感想など。</em></p>
        </article>
        <article class="voice">
          <div class="voice-av"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true"><defs><clipPath id="c3105"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="56"/></clipPath></defs>
<circle cx="60" cy="60" r="56" fill="#a9d3f5"/>
